  "definition": "Hydrofracturing",
  "effectiveDate": "2008-06-13",
  "historyNote": "#6448, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08 (from We 101.16); renumbered by #12075 (formerly We 101.17)",
